        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PRY1SMTSAL, Pryor Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Contemporary Rectangular Door Pull can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. Made from 5/8\" thick aluminum, the Pryor Door Handle is available in a huge selection of finishes; and because of its modern appearance, we think that this pull would look stunning in matte black, satin aluminum, or polished chrome. Choose from 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions PRY1SMTSAL Modern Rectangular Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<li>Pull Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-PRY02-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262330\"><b>First Impressions PRY1SMTSAL Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>PRY1018SMTSAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PRY1024SMTSAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PRY1036SMTSAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Pryor Aluminum Pull",
                "description": "This Contemporary Rectangular Door Pull can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. Made from 5/8\" thick aluminum, the Pryor Door Handle is available in a huge selection of finishes; and because of its modern appearance, we think that this pull would look stunning in matte black, satin aluminum, or polished chrome. Choose from 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. \r\n",
